  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Wondrous item, legendary (requires attunement). This jewel is in its <strong>awakened</strong> state and confers both its dormant and awakened properties.</p><p><strong>Dormant</strong></p><ul><li>+1 bonus to AC while worn.</li><li>Action: shed bright light in a 15-foot radius and dim light for an additional 15 feet, until extinguished (no action required).</li><li>3 charges, regained at dawn. Expend 1 charge to cast Invisibility.</li></ul><p><strong>Awakened</strong></p><ul><li>The AC bonus increases to +2.</li><li>Charges increase to 5.</li><li>Expend 1 charge (no action required) to end grappled, paralyzed or restrained on yourself.</li><li>When another creature you can see within 60 feet fails a saving throw, expend 1 charge as a reaction to let it reroll. The creature must use the new roll.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
